        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwosi ŋulu abu Moses kilou",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirorwa a ŋirwosi a ŋakwapin a ŋuna apotu Ŋisirael kilout, kituruwosi ŋuna kec alowae a ŋolo alo Kide Yorodan ameun anayonae Arinon akitodol lomoru Erimon kaapei ka akadipaalat ŋina a Yorodan daadaŋ ŋina alo Kide ikes lu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae epei Sikon erwosit a Ŋiamori ŋolo epukat Ecibon, emoriyarit akwap keŋ atutubet apei a akwap a Gilead. Epukat daŋ iŋes neni enyaritae Aroer neni ayai lokipetot ka akadipaalat Arinon ka etaun ŋolo eyai kidiŋ akadipaalat ŋin, akitodol naŋolol Yabok, lokukoru ka akwap Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adolit neni epukat iŋes nakadipaalat a Yorodan, alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap anam Galileya, akitodol Besyesimos, Kide anam ŋina Atwan, kiriwor jik tari nakeju a emoru Pisiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nabo kilout Og erwosit a Bacan, ŋolo arae epei alorwosi a ŋulu edoŋito alotuŋa ŋulu anyaritae Ŋirepaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ŋirepaim",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ikes ŋituŋa ŋululaŋir tooyak",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Epukat iŋes Acitorot ka Edirei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epukat iŋes ŋinapei alomoru Erimon ka Salek, Bacan daadaŋ tari lokukoru a ŋituŋa a ŋulu enyaritae Ŋigesuri ka Ŋimaakasi kaapei ka atutubet apei ŋina a Gilead, akitodol lokukoru a Sikon a erwosit a Ecibon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses eketiyan a Ekapolon ka Ŋisirael ikes apotu kilout ŋirwosi ŋuluarei ŋul. Abu Moses inak akwap ŋin ekabila a Ruben ka Gad ta atutubet apei alokabila a Manase, toruwor ŋina kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwosi ŋulu abu Yosua kilou",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yosua ka Ŋisirael kilout ŋirwosi daadaŋ ŋulu alomito akwap ŋina eyai To aŋolol Yorodan. Apotu ikes kilout erwosit a Baaligad a etaun a ŋolo ayai nakadipaalat a Lebanon a lowae ŋolo alo Kuju, tomyaasi lowae ŋolo ke emoru Alak a ŋolo eyai diyete akwap ke Edom. (Abu Yosua tokorak akwap ŋin ŋikabilae a Isirael toruwor ŋina kec, isibakit a ŋikabilae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tokorae akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui, ŋina ka adipo, ŋina a ŋakadipaalae, ŋina a ŋadipoe a ŋikamukumukui, ŋina analoŋisat ka ŋina alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap. Arae ŋakwapin ŋun eboiyoto sek Ŋiitaiti, Ŋiamori, Ŋikanaani, Ŋiperisi, Ŋiipi ka Ŋiyebusi.) Ŋirwosi ŋulu aponi kilounae ikes lu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
